ake each run about 20 s longer than needed and makes the comment misleading.\n2. **The run count can mislead.** `runs=` counts every run, but the per-stage p50s are taken only over runs where every log mark was found, so the two can cover different runs. Also, `first(cv, /Start Task/)` takes the first converter task after t0, which would pick up another task if anything else is converting at the same time. Neither matters on this single-user VM.\n3. **The browser-close question is still open.** The page closes with `runBeforeUnload: false`, so a real user's close may behave differently. The spawn request rightly asks for this to be checked.\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE save journey mapped end to end (5853 ms, 85% the configured savetimeoutdelay wait); stages add up exactly; follow-up spawned; the faulty changes-sent wait in save-run.cjs should go into a follow-up","ttft_ms":3759,"type":"result","duration_ms":29183,"uuid":"dcf9ca24-8201-4ebd-a424-f978c08a1995","ttft_stream_ms":2100,"time_to_request_ms":259,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":163,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":17,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":7,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":9,"query_setup":4,"auto_mode_context_wait":5,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":17,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":55,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":132,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":209,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":138,"process_rss_mib_result":216,"process_anon_mib_result":131,"process_peak_rss_mib":242,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1021,"process_wall_ms_turn":29183,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":295,"process_wall_ms_streaming":19688,"main_stream_count":5,"main_stream_event_count":330,"main_s